{"id":56,"name":"الواقعة","transliteration":"Al-Waqi'ah","translation_fr":"L'inévitable","translation_en":"The Inevitable","type":"meccan","total_verses":96,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِذَا وَقَعَتِ ٱلۡوَاقِعَةُ","translation_fr":"Quand l'événement (le Jugement) arrivera","translation_en":"When the Occurrence occurs","transliteration":"Itha waqaAAati alwaqiAAatu"},{"id":2,"text":"لَيۡسَ لِوَقۡعَتِهَا كَاذِبَةٌ","translation_fr":"nul ne traitera sa venue de mensonge","translation_en":"There is, at its occurrence, no denial","transliteration":"Laysa liwaqAAatiha kathibatun"},{"id":3,"text":"خَافِضَةٞ رَّافِعَةٌ","translation_fr":"Il abaissera (les uns), il élèvera (les autres)","translation_en":"It will bring down [some] and raise up [others]","transliteration":"Khafidatun rafiAAatun"},{"id":4,"text":"إِذَا رُجَّتِ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ رَجّٗا","translation_fr":"Quand la terre sera secouée violemment","translation_en":"When the earth is shaken with convulsion","transliteration":"Itha rujjati alardu rajjan"},{"id":5,"text":"وَبُسَّتِ ٱلۡجِبَالُ بَسّٗا","translation_fr":"et les montagnes seront réduites en miettes","translation_en":"And the mountains are broken down, crumbling","transliteration":"Wabussati aljibalu bassan"},{"id":6,"text":"فَكَانَتۡ هَبَآءٗ مُّنۢبَثّٗا","translation_fr":"et qu'elles deviendront poussière éparpillée","translation_en":"And become dust dispersing","transliteration":"Fakanat habaan munbaththan"},{"id":7,"text":"وَكُنتُمۡ أَزۡوَٰجٗا ثَلَٰثَةٗ","translation_fr":"alors vous serez trois catégories","translation_en":"And you become [of] three kinds","transliteration":"Wakuntum azwajan thalathatan"},{"id":8,"text":"فَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَيۡمَنَةِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَيۡمَنَةِ","translation_fr":"les gens de la droite - que sont les gens de la droite","translation_en":"Then the companions of the right - what are the companions of the right","transliteration":"Faashabu almaymanati ma ashabu almaymanati"},{"id":9,"text":"وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَشۡـَٔمَةِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَشۡـَٔمَةِ","translation_fr":"Et les gens de la gauche - que sont les gens de la gauche","translation_en":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left","transliteration":"Waashabu almashamati ma ashabu almashamati"},{"id":10,"text":"وَٱلسَّـٰبِقُونَ ٱلسَّـٰبِقُونَ","translation_fr":"Les premiers (à suivre les ordres d'Allah sur la terre) ce sont eux qui seront les premiers (dans l'au-delà)","translation_en":"And the forerunners, the forerunners","transliteration":"Waalssabiqoona alssabiqoona"},{"id":11,"text":"أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ","translation_fr":"Ce sont ceux-là les plus rapprochés d'Allah","translation_en":"Those are the ones brought near [to Allah]","transliteration":"Olaika almuqarraboona"},{"id":12,"text":"فِي جَنَّـٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","translation_fr":"dans les Jardins des délices","translation_en":"In the Gardens of Pleasure","transliteration":"Fee jannati alnnaAAeemi"},{"id":13,"text":"ثُلَّةٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"une multitude d'élus parmi les premières [générations]","translation_en":"A [large] company of the former peoples","transliteration":"Thullatun mina alawwaleena"},{"id":14,"text":"وَقَلِيلٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","translation_fr":"et un petit nombre parmi les dernières [générations]","translation_en":"And a few of the later peoples","transliteration":"Waqaleelun mina alakhireena"},{"id":15,"text":"عَلَىٰ سُرُرٖ مَّوۡضُونَةٖ","translation_fr":"sur des lits ornés [d'or et de pierreries]","translation_en":"On thrones woven [with ornament]","transliteration":"AAala sururin mawdoonatin"},{"id":16,"text":"مُّتَّكِـِٔينَ عَلَيۡهَا مُتَقَٰبِلِينَ","translation_fr":"s'y accoudant et se faisant face","translation_en":"Reclining on them, facing each other","transliteration":"Muttakieena AAalayha mutaqabileena"},{"id":17,"text":"يَطُوفُ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وِلۡدَٰنٞ مُّخَلَّدُونَ","translation_fr":"Parmi eux circuleront des garçons éternellement jeunes","translation_en":"There will circulate among them young boys made eternal","transliteration":"Yatoofu AAalayhim wildanun mukhalladoona"},{"id":18,"text":"بِأَكۡوَابٖ وَأَبَارِيقَ وَكَأۡسٖ مِّن مَّعِينٖ","translation_fr":"avec des coupes, des aiguières et un verre [rempli] d'une liqueur de source","translation_en":"With vessels, pitchers and a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring","transliteration":"Biakwabin waabareeqa wakasin min maAAeenin"},{"id":19,"text":"لَّا يُصَدَّعُونَ عَنۡهَا وَلَا يُنزِفُونَ","translation_fr":"qui ne leur provoquera ni maux de tête ni étourdissement","translation_en":"No headache will they have therefrom, nor will they be intoxicated","transliteration":"La yusaddaAAoona AAanha wala yunzifoona"},{"id":20,"text":"وَفَٰكِهَةٖ مِّمَّا يَتَخَيَّرُونَ","translation_fr":"et des fruits de leur choix","translation_en":"And fruit of what they select","transliteration":"Wafakihatin mimma yatakhayyaroona"},{"id":21,"text":"وَلَحۡمِ طَيۡرٖ مِّمَّا يَشۡتَهُونَ","translation_fr":"et toute chair d'oiseau qu'ils désireront","translation_en":"And the meat of fowl, from whatever they desire","transliteration":"Walahmi tayrin mimma yashtahoona"},{"id":22,"text":"وَحُورٌ عِينٞ","translation_fr":"Et ils auront des houris aux yeux, grands et beaux","translation_en":"And [for them are] fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes","transliteration":"Wahoorun AAeenun"},{"id":23,"text":"كَأَمۡثَٰلِ ٱللُّؤۡلُوِٕ ٱلۡمَكۡنُونِ","translation_fr":"pareilles à des perles en coquille","translation_en":"The likenesses of pearls well-protected","transliteration":"Kaamthali allului almaknooni"},{"id":24,"text":"جَزَآءَۢ بِمَا كَانُواْ يَعۡمَلُونَ","translation_fr":"en récompense pour ce qu'ils faisaient","translation_en":"As reward for what they used to do","transliteration":"Jazaan bima kanoo yaAAmaloona"},{"id":25,"text":"لَا يَسۡمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغۡوٗا وَلَا تَأۡثِيمًا","translation_fr":"Ils n'y entendront ni futilité ni blasphème","translation_en":"They will not hear therein ill speech or commission of sin","transliteration":"La yasmaAAoona feeha laghwan wala tatheeman"},{"id":26,"text":"إِلَّا قِيلٗا سَلَٰمٗا سَلَٰمٗا","translation_fr":"mais seulement les propos: «Salâm! Salâm!»... [Paix! Paix]","translation_en":"Only a saying: \"Peace, peace","transliteration":"Illa qeelan salaman salaman"},{"id":27,"text":"وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡيَمِينِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","translation_fr":"Et les gens de la droite; que sont les gens de la droite","translation_en":"The companions of the right - what are the companions of the right","transliteration":"Waashabu alyameeni ma ashabu alyameeni"},{"id":28,"text":"فِي سِدۡرٖ مَّخۡضُودٖ","translation_fr":"[Ils seront parmi] des jujubiers sans épines","translation_en":"[They will be] among lote trees with thorns removed","transliteration":"Fee sidrin makhdoodin"},{"id":29,"text":"وَطَلۡحٖ مَّنضُودٖ","translation_fr":"et parmi des bananiers aux régimes bien fournis","translation_en":"And [banana] trees layered [with fruit]","transliteration":"Watalhin mandoodin"},{"id":30,"text":"وَظِلّٖ مَّمۡدُودٖ","translation_fr":"dans une ombre étendue","translation_en":"And shade extended","transliteration":"Wathillin mamdoodin"},{"id":31,"text":"وَمَآءٖ مَّسۡكُوبٖ","translation_fr":"[près] d'une eau coulant continuellement","translation_en":"And water poured out","transliteration":"Wamain maskoobin"},{"id":32,"text":"وَفَٰكِهَةٖ كَثِيرَةٖ","translation_fr":"et des fruits abondants","translation_en":"And fruit, abundant [and varied]","transliteration":"Wafakihatin katheeratin"},{"id":33,"text":"لَّا مَقۡطُوعَةٖ وَلَا مَمۡنُوعَةٖ","translation_fr":"ni interrompus ni défendus","translation_en":"Neither limited [to season] nor forbidden","transliteration":"La maqtooAAatin wala mamnooAAatin"},{"id":34,"text":"وَفُرُشٖ مَّرۡفُوعَةٍ","translation_fr":"sur des lits surélevés","translation_en":"And [upon] beds raised high","transliteration":"Wafurushin marfooAAatin"},{"id":35,"text":"إِنَّآ أَنشَأۡنَٰهُنَّ إِنشَآءٗ","translation_fr":"C'est Nous qui les avons créées à la perfection","translation_en":"Indeed, We have produced the women of Paradise in a [new] creation","transliteration":"Inna anshanahunna inshaan"},{"id":36,"text":"فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُنَّ أَبۡكَارًا","translation_fr":"et Nous les avons faites vierges","translation_en":"And made them virgins","transliteration":"FajaAAalnahunna abkaran"},{"id":37,"text":"عُرُبًا أَتۡرَابٗا","translation_fr":"gracieuses, toutes de même âge","translation_en":"Devoted [to their husbands] and of equal age","transliteration":"AAuruban atraban"},{"id":38,"text":"لِّأَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","translation_fr":"pour les gens de la droite","translation_en":"For the companions of the right [who are]","transliteration":"Liashabi alyameeni"},{"id":39,"text":"ثُلَّةٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"une multitude d'élus parmi les premières [générations]","translation_en":"A company of the former peoples","transliteration":"Thullatun mina alawwaleena"},{"id":40,"text":"وَثُلَّةٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","translation_fr":"et une multitude d'élus parmi les dernières [générations]","translation_en":"And a company of the later peoples","transliteration":"Wathullatun mina alakhireena"},{"id":41,"text":"وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ","translation_fr":"Et les gens de la gauche; que sont les gens de la gauche","translation_en":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left","transliteration":"Waashabu alshshimali ma ashabu alshshimali"},{"id":42,"text":"فِي سَمُومٖ وَحَمِيمٖ","translation_fr":"ils seront au milieu d'un souffle brûlant et d'une eau bouillante","translation_en":"[They will be] in scorching fire and scalding water","transliteration":"Fee samoomin wahameemin"},{"id":43,"text":"وَظِلّٖ مِّن يَحۡمُومٖ","translation_fr":"à l'ombre d'une fumée noire","translation_en":"And a shade of black smoke","transliteration":"Wathillin min yahmoomin"},{"id":44,"text":"لَّا بَارِدٖ وَلَا كَرِيمٍ","translation_fr":"ni fraîche, ni douce","translation_en":"Neither cool nor beneficial","transliteration":"La baridin wala kareemin"},{"id":45,"text":"إِنَّهُمۡ كَانُواْ قَبۡلَ ذَٰلِكَ مُتۡرَفِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils vivaient auparavant dans le luxe","translation_en":"Indeed they were, before that, indulging in affluence","transliteration":"Innahum kanoo qabla thalika mutrafeena"},{"id":46,"text":"وَكَانُواْ يُصِرُّونَ عَلَى ٱلۡحِنثِ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","translation_fr":"Ils persistaient dans le grand péché [le polythéisme]","translation_en":"And they used to persist in the great violation","transliteration":"Wakanoo yusirroona AAala alhinthi alAAatheemi"},{"id":47,"text":"وَكَانُواْ يَقُولُونَ أَئِذَا مِتۡنَا وَكُنَّا تُرَابٗا وَعِظَٰمًا أَءِنَّا لَمَبۡعُوثُونَ","translation_fr":"et disaient: «Quand nous mourrons et serons poussière et ossements, serons-nous ressuscités","translation_en":"And they used to say, \"When we die and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected","transliteration":"Wakanoo yaqooloona aitha mitna wakunna turaban waAAithaman ainna lamabAAoothoona"},{"id":48,"text":"أَوَءَابَآؤُنَا ٱلۡأَوَّلُونَ","translation_fr":"ainsi que nos anciens ancêtres?..»","translation_en":"And our forefathers [as well]","transliteration":"Awa abaona alawwaloona"},{"id":49,"text":"قُلۡ إِنَّ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ وَٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Dis: «En vérité les premiers et les derniers","translation_en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Indeed, the former and the later peoples","transliteration":"Qul inna alawwaleena waalakhireena"},{"id":50,"text":"لَمَجۡمُوعُونَ إِلَىٰ مِيقَٰتِ يَوۡمٖ مَّعۡلُومٖ","translation_fr":"seront réunis pour le rendez-vous d'un jour connu»","translation_en":"Are to be gathered together for the appointment of a known Day","transliteration":"LamajmooAAoona ila meeqati yawmin maAAloomin"},{"id":51,"text":"ثُمَّ إِنَّكُمۡ أَيُّهَا ٱلضَّآلُّونَ ٱلۡمُكَذِّبُونَ","translation_fr":"Et puis, vous, les égarés, qui traitiez (la Résurrection) de mensonge","translation_en":"Then indeed you, O those astray [who are] deniers","transliteration":"Thumma innakum ayyuha alddalloona almukaththiboona"},{"id":52,"text":"لَأٓكِلُونَ مِن شَجَرٖ مِّن زَقُّومٖ","translation_fr":"vous mangerez certainement d'un arbre de Zaqqûm","translation_en":"Will be eating from trees of zaqqum","transliteration":"Laakiloona min shajarin min zaqqoomin"},{"id":53,"text":"فَمَالِـُٔونَ مِنۡهَا ٱلۡبُطُونَ","translation_fr":"vous vous en remplirez le ventre","translation_en":"And filling with it your bellies","transliteration":"Famalioona minha albutoona"},{"id":54,"text":"فَشَٰرِبُونَ عَلَيۡهِ مِنَ ٱلۡحَمِيمِ","translation_fr":"puis vous boirez par-dessus cela de l'eau bouillante","translation_en":"And drinking on top of it from scalding water","transliteration":"Fashariboona AAalayhi mina alhameemi"},{"id":55,"text":"فَشَٰرِبُونَ شُرۡبَ ٱلۡهِيمِ","translation_fr":"vous en boirez comme boivent les chameaux assoiffés","translation_en":"And will drink as the drinking of thirsty camels","transliteration":"Fashariboona shurba alheemi"},{"id":56,"text":"هَٰذَا نُزُلُهُمۡ يَوۡمَ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"Voilà le repas d'accueil qui leur sera servi, au jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"That is their accommodation on the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Hatha nuzuluhum yawma alddeeni"},{"id":57,"text":"نَحۡنُ خَلَقۡنَٰكُمۡ فَلَوۡلَا تُصَدِّقُونَ","translation_fr":"C'est Nous qui vous avons créés. Pourquoi ne croiriez-vous donc pas [à la résurrection]","translation_en":"We have created you, so why do you not believe","transliteration":"Nahnu khalaqnakum falawla tusaddiqoona"},{"id":58,"text":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُم مَّا تُمۡنُونَ","translation_fr":"Voyez-vous donc ce que vous éjaculez","translation_en":"Have you seen that which you emit","transliteration":"Afaraaytum ma tumnoona"},{"id":59,"text":"ءَأَنتُمۡ تَخۡلُقُونَهُۥٓ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلۡخَٰلِقُونَ","translation_fr":"est-ce vous qui le créez ou [en] sommes Nous le Créateur","translation_en":"Is it you who creates it, or are We the Creator","transliteration":"Aantum takhluqoonahu am nahnu alkhaliqoona"},{"id":60,"text":"نَحۡنُ قَدَّرۡنَا بَيۡنَكُمُ ٱلۡمَوۡتَ وَمَا نَحۡنُ بِمَسۡبُوقِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous avons prédéterminé la mort parmi vous. Nous ne serons point empêchés","translation_en":"We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone","transliteration":"Nahnu qaddarna baynakumu almawta wama nahnu bimasbooqeena"},{"id":61,"text":"عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّبَدِّلَ أَمۡثَٰلَكُمۡ وَنُنشِئَكُمۡ فِي مَا لَا تَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"de vous remplacer par vos semblables, et vous faire renaître dans [un état] que vous ne savez pas","translation_en":"In that We will change your likenesses and produce you in that [form] which you do not know","transliteration":"AAala an nubaddila amthalakum wanunshiakum fee ma la taAAlamoona"},{"id":62,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ عَلِمۡتُمُ ٱلنَّشۡأَةَ ٱلۡأُولَىٰ فَلَوۡلَا تَذَكَّرُونَ","translation_fr":"Vous avez connu la première création. Ne vous rappelez-vous donc pas","translation_en":"And you have already known the first creation, so will you not remember","transliteration":"Walaqad AAalimtumu alnnashata aloola falawla tathakkaroona"},{"id":63,"text":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُم مَّا تَحۡرُثُونَ","translation_fr":"Voyez-vous donc ce que vous labourez","translation_en":"And have you seen that [seed] which you sow","transliteration":"Afaraaytum ma tahruthoona"},{"id":64,"text":"ءَأَنتُمۡ تَزۡرَعُونَهُۥٓ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلزَّـٰرِعُونَ","translation_fr":"Est-ce vous qui le cultivez? ou [en] sommes Nous le cultivateur","translation_en":"Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower","transliteration":"Aantum tazraAAoonahu am nahnu alzzariAAoona"},{"id":65,"text":"لَوۡ نَشَآءُ لَجَعَلۡنَٰهُ حُطَٰمٗا فَظَلۡتُمۡ تَفَكَّهُونَ","translation_fr":"Si Nous voulions, Nous le réduirions en débris. Et vous ne cesseriez pas de vous étonner et [de crier]","translation_en":"If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder","transliteration":"Law nashao lajaAAalnahu hutaman fathaltum tafakkahoona"},{"id":66,"text":"إِنَّا لَمُغۡرَمُونَ","translation_fr":"«Nous voilà endettés","translation_en":"[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt","transliteration":"Inna lamughramoona"},{"id":67,"text":"بَلۡ نَحۡنُ مَحۡرُومُونَ","translation_fr":"ou plutôt, exposés aux privations»","translation_en":"Rather, we have been deprived","transliteration":"Bal nahnu mahroomoona"},{"id":68,"text":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُمُ ٱلۡمَآءَ ٱلَّذِي تَشۡرَبُونَ","translation_fr":"Voyez-vous donc l'eau que vous buvez","translation_en":"And have you seen the water that you drink","transliteration":"Afaraaytumu almaa allathee tashraboona"},{"id":69,"text":"ءَأَنتُمۡ أَنزَلۡتُمُوهُ مِنَ ٱلۡمُزۡنِ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلۡمُنزِلُونَ","translation_fr":"Est-ce vous qui l'avez fait descendre du nuage? ou [en] sommes Nous le descendeur","translation_en":"Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down","transliteration":"Aantum anzaltumoohu mina almuzni am nahnu almunziloona"},{"id":70,"text":"لَوۡ نَشَآءُ جَعَلۡنَٰهُ أُجَاجٗا فَلَوۡلَا تَشۡكُرُونَ","translation_fr":"Si Nous voulions, Nous la rendrions salée. Pourquoi n'êtes-vous donc pas reconnaissants","translation_en":"If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful","transliteration":"Law nashao jaAAalnahu ojajan falawla tashkuroona"},{"id":71,"text":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُمُ ٱلنَّارَ ٱلَّتِي تُورُونَ","translation_fr":"Voyez-vous donc le feu que vous obtenez par frottement","translation_en":"And have you seen the fire that you ignite","transliteration":"Afaraaytumu alnnara allatee tooroona"},{"id":72,"text":"ءَأَنتُمۡ أَنشَأۡتُمۡ شَجَرَتَهَآ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلۡمُنشِـُٔونَ","translation_fr":"Est-ce vous qui avez créé son arbre ou [en] sommes Nous le Créateur","translation_en":"Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer","transliteration":"Aantum anshatum shajarataha am nahnu almunshioona"},{"id":73,"text":"نَحۡنُ جَعَلۡنَٰهَا تَذۡكِرَةٗ وَمَتَٰعٗا لِّلۡمُقۡوِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous en avons fait un rappel (de l'Enfer), et un élément utile pour ceux qui en ont besoin","translation_en":"We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers","transliteration":"Nahnu jaAAalnaha tathkiratan wamataAAan lilmuqweena"},{"id":74,"text":"فَسَبِّحۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","translation_fr":"Glorifie donc le nom de ton Seigneur, le Très Grand","translation_en":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great","transliteration":"Fasabbih biismi rabbika alAAatheemi"},{"id":75,"text":"۞فَلَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِمَوَٰقِعِ ٱلنُّجُومِ","translation_fr":"Non!.. Je jure par les positions des étoiles (dans le firmament)","translation_en":"Then I swear by the setting of the stars","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu bimawaqiAAi alnnujoomi"},{"id":76,"text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَقَسَمٞ لَّوۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ عَظِيمٌ","translation_fr":"Et c'est vraiment un serment solennel, si vous saviez","translation_en":"And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great","transliteration":"Wainnahu laqasamun law taAAlamoona AAatheemun"},{"id":77,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقُرۡءَانٞ كَرِيمٞ","translation_fr":"Et c'est certainement un Coran noble","translation_en":"Indeed, it is a noble Qur'an","transliteration":"Innahu laquranun kareemun"},{"id":78,"text":"فِي كِتَٰبٖ مَّكۡنُونٖ","translation_fr":"dans un Livre bien gardé","translation_en":"In a Register well-protected","transliteration":"Fee kitabin maknoonin"},{"id":79,"text":"لَّا يَمَسُّهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلۡمُطَهَّرُونَ","translation_fr":"que seuls les purifiés touchent","translation_en":"None touch it except the purified","transliteration":"La yamassuhu illa almutahharoona"},{"id":80,"text":"تَنزِيلٞ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"C'est une révélation de la part du Seigneur de l'Univers","translation_en":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Tanzeelun min rabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":81,"text":"أَفَبِهَٰذَا ٱلۡحَدِيثِ أَنتُم مُّدۡهِنُونَ","translation_fr":"Est-ce ce discours-là que vous traitez de mensonge","translation_en":"Then is it to this statement that you are indifferent","transliteration":"Afabihatha alhadeethi antum mudhinoona"},{"id":82,"text":"وَتَجۡعَلُونَ رِزۡقَكُمۡ أَنَّكُمۡ تُكَذِّبُونَ","translation_fr":"Et est-ce pour vous [une façon d'être reconnaissant] à votre subsistance que de traiter (le Coran) de mensonge","translation_en":"And make [the thanks for] your provision that you deny [the Provider]","transliteration":"WatajAAaloona rizqakum annakum tukaththiboona"},{"id":83,"text":"فَلَوۡلَآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلۡحُلۡقُومَ","translation_fr":"Lorsque le souffle de la vie remonte à la gorge (d'un moribond)","translation_en":"Then why, when the soul at death reaches the throat","transliteration":"Falawla itha balaghati alhulqooma"},{"id":84,"text":"وَأَنتُمۡ حِينَئِذٖ تَنظُرُونَ","translation_fr":"et qu'à ce moment là vous regardez","translation_en":"And you are at that time looking on","transliteration":"Waantum heenaithin tanthuroona"},{"id":85,"text":"وَنَحۡنُ أَقۡرَبُ إِلَيۡهِ مِنكُمۡ وَلَٰكِن لَّا تُبۡصِرُونَ","translation_fr":"et que Nous sommes plus proche de lui que vous [qui l'entourez] mais vous ne [le] voyez point","translation_en":"And Our angels are nearer to him than you, but you do not see","transliteration":"Wanahnu aqrabu ilayhi minkum walakin la tubsiroona"},{"id":86,"text":"فَلَوۡلَآ إِن كُنتُمۡ غَيۡرَ مَدِينِينَ","translation_fr":"Pourquoi donc, si vous croyez que vous n'avez pas de compte à rendre","translation_en":"Then why do you not, if you are not to be recompensed","transliteration":"Falawla in kuntum ghayra madeeneena"},{"id":87,"text":"تَرۡجِعُونَهَآ إِن كُنتُمۡ صَٰدِقِينَ","translation_fr":"ne la faites-vous pas revenir [cette âme], si vous êtes véridiques","translation_en":"Bring it back, if you should be truthful","transliteration":"TarjiAAoonaha in kuntum sadiqeena"},{"id":88,"text":"فَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُقَرَّبِينَ","translation_fr":"Si celui-ci est du nombre des rapprochés (d'Allah)","translation_en":"And if the deceased was of those brought near to Allah","transliteration":"Faamma in kana mina almuqarrabeena"},{"id":89,"text":"فَرَوۡحٞ وَرَيۡحَانٞ وَجَنَّتُ نَعِيمٖ","translation_fr":"alors (il aura) du repos, de la grâce et un Jardin de délices","translation_en":"Then [for him is] rest and bounty and a garden of pleasure","transliteration":"Farawhun warayhanun wajannatu naAAeemin"},{"id":90,"text":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنۡ أَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","translation_fr":"Et s'il est du nombre des gens de la droite","translation_en":"And if he was of the companions of the right","transliteration":"Waamma in kana min ashabi alyameeni"},{"id":91,"text":"فَسَلَٰمٞ لَّكَ مِنۡ أَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","translation_fr":"il sera [accueilli par ces mots]: «Paix à toi» de la part des gens de la droite","translation_en":"Then [the angels will say], \"Peace for you; [you are] from the companions of the right","transliteration":"Fasalamun laka min ashabi alyameeni"},{"id":92,"text":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","translation_fr":"Et s'il est de ceux qui avaient traité de mensonge (la résurrection) et s'étaient égarés","translation_en":"But if he was of the deniers [who were] astray","transliteration":"Waamma in kana mina almukaththibeena alddalleena"},{"id":93,"text":"فَنُزُلٞ مِّنۡ حَمِيمٖ","translation_fr":"alors, il sera installé dans une eau bouillante","translation_en":"Then [for him is] accommodation of scalding water","transliteration":"Fanuzulun min hameemin"},{"id":94,"text":"وَتَصۡلِيَةُ جَحِيمٍ","translation_fr":"et il brûlera dans la Fournaise","translation_en":"And burning in Hellfire","transliteration":"Watasliyatu jaheemin"},{"id":95,"text":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَهُوَ حَقُّ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","translation_fr":"C'est cela la pleine certitude","translation_en":"Indeed, this is the true certainty","transliteration":"Inna hatha lahuwa haqqu alyaqeeni"},{"id":96,"text":"فَسَبِّحۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","translation_fr":"Glorifie donc le nom de ton Seigneur, le Très Grand","translation_en":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great","transliteration":"Fasabbih biismi rabbika alAAatheemi"}]}